  "id": "task-cohesion",
  "term": "task cohesion",
  "definition": "Task cohesion is the extent to which a team comes together around carrying out its performance tasks and pursuing immediate shared outcomes. In the source, it refers to a form of team unity based more on confidence in a coach’s competence and tactical reliability than on emotional closeness between team members.",
